            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[IPTVMac 0.25.70 for Apple Silicon Macs running macOS 14 or later.

- Fixed a live playback interruption while scrolling the category menu in the player's Channels panel. Playback state updates continue while the menu is open, avoiding a false stall and automatic reconnect.
- Large category menus keep their entries in place while the video plays. Selecting a category changes the channel list, and selecting a channel changes the stream.

This build uses Apple Development signing and is unnotarized. macOS may block first launch. The ZIP and update feed are signed for Sparkle.
]]></description>
